# IMS — Monorepo .gitignore

# Dependencies
**/node_modules/
**/.pnp
**/.pnp.js

**/venv
# Build outputs
**/build/
**/dist/
**/.next/

# Environment files — NEVER commit real secrets
**/.env
# Keep example files — they are safe to commit
!**/.env.example

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Editor
.vscode/settings.json
.idea/

# Testing
**/coverage/

# Temp
/tmp/